{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47926","headline":"与崔渥冥会杂诗 二 · 湘妃庙","name":"与崔渥冥会杂诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春鸟交交引思浓，岂期尘迹拜仙宫。\n鸾歌凤舞飘珠翠，疑是阳台一梦中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"湘妃庙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}